ということで2曲続けてお送りしました クリエイティングワールド テイクミートゥーヘブン でした！
With that, we've delivered two songs in a row: "Creating World" and "Take me to heaven"!

134
00:27:57,307 --> 00:28:00,507
いかがでしたか？ お水飲んでもいいですか？ (笑)
How was it? Is it alright if I have some water? (Laughs)

135
00:28:01,007 --> 00:28:04,007
ライブお決まり事 お水を飲む
It's the concert tradition: drinking water.

136
00:28:08,007 --> 00:28:17,007
お水飲みました！お水ありがとう！みんなお水、お水スタンプありがとね！
I drank water! Thanks for the water! Everyone, thanks for the water stamps!

137
00:28:17,507 --> 00:28:29,007
すごい、すごい大量のお水が溢れんばかりにありがとうございます。お水助かる。お水助かります。ありがとうございます。700円ありがとうございます。
Wow, thank you so much for the overflowing amount of water. Water is a lifesaver. Water really helps. Thank you!

138
00:28:29,807 --> 00:28:49,007
はい、ということでですね、この感じでどんどん行きたいと思うんですけれども、ここからはですね、まあちょっと、AZKiのちょっと可愛い、可愛い感じのAZKiを、ちょっと…溺れるほどのお水、ありがとうございます！えっと、可愛い感じのAZKiを見せていきたいと思います！
Right, so with that feeling, I'd like to keep going, but from here on... well, AZKi's cute, somewhat cute side—wait, thanks for the water enough to drown in! Um, I want to show you a cute AZKi!

139
00:28:49,007 --> 00:28:53,807
ということで、この曲聞いてください、「リアルメランコリー」！
With that, please listen to this song: "Real Melancholy"!

140
00:28:56,507 --> 00:29:01,007
答えを教えて より夜更けメルランコリー
Tell me the answer, a late-night melancholy.

141
00:29:01,807 --> 00:29:04,007
みんなで！ イェーイ！
Everyone together! Yay!

142
00:29:11,507 --> 00:29:19,507
体の感情が交差する ただしい自分をなにに
My bodily emotions intersect—what am I basing my true self on?

143
00:29:20,007 --> 00:29:26,507
ニトサンを凌いで交差する 世界は一つじゃない
Surpassing two or three, intersecting, the world isn't just one.

144
00:29:29,007 --> 00:29:32,007
いねグットファボの数字増えていく
Likes, goods, and favorite numbers keep increasing.

145
00:29:34,007 --> 00:29:42,007
まん丸にセロファンかざして 首を締める 私の生きる世界は
Holding a cellophane over a full circle, tightening my neck—the world I live in...

146
00:29:43,007 --> 00:29:46,507
自分の手で選ばせてよ
Let me choose it with my own hands!

147
00:29:48,007 --> 00:29:52,507
真夜中のメランコリー 生まれ変わるアイデンティティ
Midnight melancholy, a reborn identity.

148
00:29:53,007 --> 00:29:57,007
好みがこのへんなんだよ
My tastes are kind of weird like this!

149
00:29:57,507 --> 00:29:59,007
上っ面だけのヒストリー
A superficial history...

150
00:30:02,523 --> 00:30:05,063
私は 私は
Am I... am I...

151
00:30:05,063 --> 00:30:08,183
誰かにとって 壊れるの？
breaking for someone else?

152
00:30:18,793 --> 00:30:22,403
理想と現実が交差する
Where reality and ideals intersect,

153
00:30:22,743 --> 00:30:25,983
正しい率はどこ？
where is the right me?

154
00:30:27,783 --> 00:30:31,783
再生回数が落ちていく
Play counts are dropping;

155
00:30:31,983 --> 00:30:36,923
世界はどこも同じだ
the world is the same everywhere.

156
00:30:37,143 --> 00:30:41,703
キャラ属性カテゴライズされていく
Being categorized by character attributes—

157
00:30:41,903 --> 00:30:45,703
誰かに決め付けられた流行りは嫌だな
I hate trends forced upon me by others.

158
00:30:46,763 --> 00:30:49,863
私のやりたいことは
What I want to do...

159
00:30:50,063 --> 00:30:53,663
自分の手で決めさせてよ
let me decide with my own hands!

160
00:30:56,083 --> 00:30:58,663
真夜中のメランコリー
Midnight melancholy,

161
00:30:58,863 --> 00:31:01,223
生まれ変わるアイデンティティ
a reborn identity.

162
00:31:01,423 --> 00:31:05,123
この波が このへんが 痛いよ
This wave, right here, hurts so much.

163
00:31:05,123 --> 00:31:07,483
分かんないこの想い
I don't understand this feeling,

164
00:31:07,483 --> 00:31:10,503
同じじゃない つまる想い
it's not the same, this clogged feeling.

165
00:31:10,503 --> 00:31:13,983
私は 私は 誰かにとって
Am I... am I for someone...

166
00:31:16,383 --> 00:31:17,163
壊れるの？
breaking?

167
00:31:17,743 --> 00:31:21,423
流行りも好きも どっちも欲しい
Trends and what I love—I want both.

168
00:31:21,623 --> 00:31:26,923
矛盾の文字を 繰り返していく
Repeating words of contradiction.

169
00:31:27,783 --> 00:31:31,423
何番目のコピーじゃないの
I'm not just copy number whatever!

170
00:31:31,643 --> 00:31:35,663
永遠の夜を超えていく 見知らぬ世界へ
Crossing an eternal night to an unfamiliar world.

171
00:31:39,503 --> 00:31:43,443
ひとりめの手を繋いで
Holding hands with the first me...

172
00:31:44,563 --> 00:31:47,263
真夜中のメランコリー
Midnight melancholy,

173
00:31:47,463 --> 00:31:49,483
生まれ変わるアイデンティティ
a reborn identity.

174
00:31:50,063 --> 00:31:53,663
好みが このへんが 痛いよ
This preference, right here, hurts so much.

175
00:31:53,663 --> 00:31:56,362
分かんない この想い
I don't understand this feeling—

176
00:31:56,362 --> 00:31:59,743
どこかの世界の君へ
to you in some world,

177
00:31:59,743 --> 00:32:03,362
私と似る気持ちの君へ エールを送るよ
to you with feelings like mine, I send my cheering.

178
00:32:04,243 --> 00:32:06,683
真夜中のメランコリー
Midnight melancholy,

179
00:32:06,883 --> 00:32:09,183
生まれ変わるアイデンティティ
a reborn identity.

180
00:32:09,663 --> 00:32:13,083
好みが このへんが 痛いけど
Even though this preference right here hurts,

181
00:32:13,083 --> 00:32:16,162
どこかの世界の君へ
to you in some world,

182
00:32:16,162 --> 00:32:19,843
私と似る気持ちの君へ エールを送るよ
to you with feelings like mine, I send my cheering—

183
00:32:19,843 --> 00:32:24,362
君と私のために
for you and for me.

184
00:33:06,163 --> 00:33:10,923
どうして気付いてしまったの
Why did I have to realize it?

185
00:33:11,203 --> 00:33:17,703
熱くなるほどに 隠しきれない 戸惑い
Confusion I can't hide no matter how passionate I get.

186
00:33:18,063 --> 00:33:23,862
微妙な距離 およそやらな姿勢
A delicate distance, a half-hearted posture—

187
00:33:23,862 --> 00:33:29,383
揺れる心割れないように
so my wavering heart doesn't break.

188
00:33:30,163 --> 00:33:35,403
愛おしい響く胸の鼓動
An endearing, echoing beat in my chest.

189
00:33:35,843 --> 00:33:41,403
呼吸さえままならないのに
Even breathing is beyond me,

190
00:33:41,603 --> 00:33:47,103
きっとどこかで願っているんだ 終わりのない時間を
yet surely I'm wishing somewhere for endless time.

191
00:33:47,743 --> 00:33:54,003
恋の始まりは誰も知らない 私だけの宝物
The start of love is known by no one—a treasure only mine.

192
00:33:54,383 --> 00:34:00,003
少しでも言葉何かにしたら
If I turn it into words, even a little,

193
00:34:00,263 --> 00:34:05,303
飛沫のような笑顔 ぐしゃぶりの泣き顔も全部無くしてしまいそうで
it feels like I'd lose smiles like splashing spray and weeping faces entirely.

194
00:34:17,163 --> 00:34:20,923
もしもひとつだけ叶うんならば
If only one wish could come true,

195
00:34:20,923 --> 00:34:24,703
ただ君のすぐ隣で 過ぎてゆく季節を眺めていたい
I'd want to watch the passing seasons right by your side.

196
00:34:33,563 --> 00:34:39,362
溢れそうな想いは 胸の奥にしまい込んだ
Overflowing feelings tucked deep in my chest—

197
00:34:39,362 --> 00:34:42,362
ふたりの声は空に 吸い込まれてく
our voices are sucked into the sky.

198
00:35:02,603 --> 00:35:04,803
隠した方の左目に どんな僕を映し出すの
What kind of me are you reflecting in your hidden left eye?

199
00:35:05,003 --> 00:35:07,603
開けた方の右目だけじゃ 本当の僕は見えないでしょ
With only your open right eye, you can't see the real me, can you?

200
00:35:07,803 --> 00:35:11,003
シリョクケンサ 二重線の僕が 悪戯に微笑むの
Visual inspection. A double-lined me smiles mischievously.

201
00:35:11,303 --> 00:35:13,703
忘れないで 君の中に 偽物の僕がいる
Don't forget, there is a fake me inside of you.

202
00:35:13,703 --> 00:35:17,103
指示して教えてよ 君の目には見えてるんでしょ
Point and tell me, you can see it with your eyes, can't you?

203
00:35:17,603 --> 00:35:21,003
僕の心の隙間が ぼやけて見えるのならば
If the gaps in my heart appear blurred,

204
00:35:21,003 --> 00:35:23,703
目を閉じて構わないから 君が思うままに
You don't need to close your eyes, just as you wish.

205
00:35:23,903 --> 00:35:26,703
正しく僕を愛せるように 君の目を矯正したくて
Wanting to correct your eyes so you can love me correctly,

206
00:35:26,903 --> 00:35:29,703
使い古したその眼鏡じゃ 本当の僕は見えないでしょ
With those worn-out glasses, you can't see the real me, can you?

207
00:35:30,003 --> 00:35:32,703
シリョクケンサ 消えかけの僕が 悲しげに微笑むの
Visual inspection. A fading me smiles sadly.

208
00:35:32,803 --> 00:35:35,703
忘れないで 君の中に ほんとうの僕がいる
Don't forget, there is a real me inside of you.

209
00:35:36,003 --> 00:35:38,703
目に映るものだけを 信じることしかできない
I can only believe in what is reflected in my eyes,

210
00:35:38,703 --> 00:35:40,703
僕も君も同じだ
You and I are the same.

211
00:35:41,003 --> 00:35:44,003
だからこそ今だけは その心に焼き付けてよ
That's why, only for now, burn it into your heart—

212
00:35:44,003 --> 00:35:45,703
君が知らない僕を
The me you don't know.

213
00:35:45,803 --> 00:35:48,703
少しずつ見えなくなった あの頃は見えた景色
Little by little, the scenery I used to see became invisible.

214
00:35:48,703 --> 00:35:51,303
変わったのは君の方か それとも自分の方か
Did you change, or did I?

215
00:35:51,503 --> 00:35:54,303
指示して教えてよ 君の目には見えてるんでしょ
Point and tell me, you can see it with your eyes, can't you?

216
00:35:54,503 --> 00:35:57,303
僕の心の隙間が ぼやけて見えるのならば
If the gaps in my heart appear blurred,

217
00:35:57,503 --> 00:35:59,703
この胸に手を当て 君に伝えるから
Place your hand on this chest, I will convey it to you—

218
00:36:00,003 --> 00:36:01,703
ほんとうの僕を
The real me.

219
00:36:04,603 --> 00:36:07,603
いつか大人になってしまうのならば
If we someday grow up to be adults,

220
00:36:07,603 --> 00:36:11,003
誰よりもただ二人で 振り向いた先で笑っててほしい
more than anyone, I want the two of us to keep smiling as we look back.

221
00:36:11,303 --> 00:36:14,303
どこまでも募る想いが いつまでもここに在るんだ
The feelings growing endlessly will always be here,

222
00:36:14,603 --> 00:36:17,603
二人の声は空に 溶けてしまう
Our two voices will melt into the sky.

223
00:36:41,303 --> 00:36:44,303
恋の始まりは誰も知らない
Nobody knows the beginning of love,

224
00:36:44,303 --> 00:36:47,803
私だけの宝物を 少しでも言葉なんかにしたくなくて
Reluctant to put my own treasure into words, even a little,

225
00:36:47,803 --> 00:36:51,503
緋弾まりのような笑顔も どしゃぶりの泣き顔も全部
Even the blushing smile, even the downpour of tears,

226
00:37:02,503 --> 00:37:03,503
なくしてしまいそうで
as if I'm about to lose them all...

227
00:37:03,503 --> 00:37:06,003
もしもし一つだけ叶うのならば
If even one wish could come true,

228
00:37:06,003 --> 00:37:09,303
ただ君のすぐ隣で 過ぎていく季節眺めていたい
I just want to watch the passing seasons right by your side.

229
00:37:09,303 --> 00:37:12,303
呆れそうなほどの想いが 胸の奥にしまい込んだ
Feelings almost too absurd, locked deep in my chest,

230
00:37:12,703 --> 00:37:15,703
二人の声は空に 溶けてしまう
Our two voices will melt into the sky.

231
00:37:16,003 --> 00:37:20,003
呆れそうなほどの想いが 胸の奥にしまい込んだ
Feelings almost too absurd, locked deep in my chest,

232
00:37:20,003 --> 00:37:23,003
二人の声は空に 溶けてしまう
Our two voices will melt into the sky,

233
00:37:23,003 --> 00:37:28,003
吸い込まれてく
getting swallowed up.

234
00:37:45,003 --> 00:37:47,503
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

235
00:37:48,503 --> 00:37:52,503
はーい、いっぱいハートと拍手ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for all the hearts and applause!

236
00:37:52,503 --> 00:37:55,503
見えてますよ、見えてますよ！
I can see them, I can see them!

237
00:37:56,503 --> 00:38:00,503
はい、ということで、お水も飲みます。
Yes, so, I'm going to have some water.

238
00:38:00,503 --> 00:38:04,503
お水飲んでね。
Drinking water, you know.

239
00:38:06,003 --> 00:38:11,003
あずきのソロパートもいよいよラスト2曲となっております。
AZKi's solo part is finally down to the last two songs.

240
00:38:12,003 --> 00:38:15,503
皆さんまだまだ、まだまだ盛り上がっていけますか？
Everyone, can you still keep getting more and more hyped?

241
00:38:16,003 --> 00:38:18,503
水たっぷりありがとうね。
Thanks so much for the water.

242
00:38:19,503 --> 00:38:22,503
まだまだ盛り上がっていけますか？
Can you still keep getting hyped?

243
00:38:22,503 --> 00:38:23,503
声援と！
Cheers!

244
00:38:24,003 --> 00:38:30,503
ちょっと、ちょっと時差があるけど、いえーい！
There's a bit of a time lag, but yay!

245
00:38:31,503 --> 00:38:38,503
じゃあね、みんなにもね、歌ってもらいたいと思います。
Now, I'd like everyone to sing along too.

246
00:38:38,503 --> 00:38:45,503
みんなウォウォウォして、笑いたいなと思います。
I want us all to 'woah-woah-woah' and smile together.

247
00:38:38,503 --> 00:38:50,503
ということで、次はこの曲、発光体ソーラーサイクル！
And so, next song is—"Hakkoutai Solar Cycle"!

248
00:38:52,003 --> 00:38:56,503
明日を照らすよ sunshine
Illuminating tomorrow, sunshine,

249
00:38:56,503 --> 00:39:01,003
窓から射し込む...扉開いて
streaming through the window... opening the door.

250
00:39:02,003 --> 00:39:05,003
壊してなくなった壁は
The wall that was broken and gone,

251
00:39:06,003 --> 00:39:08,503
いつかあったことも忘れて
forgetting it was ever even there,

252
00:39:08,503 --> 00:39:13,503
壊すためのその拳は 何を作るの
that fist meant for destroying, what is it making?

253
00:39:13,503 --> 00:39:18,003
離れた星の住人が わけも知らず
The inhabitants of a distant star, without knowing why,

254
00:39:18,003 --> 00:39:23,003
またぶつかり合っている
are colliding with each other once again.

255
00:39:23,503 --> 00:39:29,003
ステージのバックライトは 背中に感じるだけじゃない
The stage's backlight isn't just something felt on the back,

256
00:39:29,003 --> 00:39:33,503
次に立つ誰かのために 輝いている
it's shining for whoever stands next.

257
00:39:34,003 --> 00:39:38,003
今すぐ世界は 変わらないけど
The world won't change right away, but

258
00:39:38,003 --> 00:39:43,503
11年後の君に歌うよ
I'll sing to you 11 years from now.

259
00:39:44,003 --> 00:39:49,003
今日も夜空は こんなに冷たいのに
Even though tonight's night sky is so cold,

260
00:39:49,003 --> 00:39:54,003
この街の灯は いつも熱い
this city's lights are always warm.

261
00:39:54,503 --> 00:40:01,503
一人一人のストーリーが あふれているから
Because each and every person's story overflows.

262
00:40:02,211 --> 00:40:03,411
あふれているから
Because it's overflowing,

263
00:40:03,511 --> 00:40:04,211
だから
so

264
00:40:04,911 --> 00:40:07,311
飛び出せ Say Hello!
jump out and say hello!

265
00:40:07,311 --> 00:40:09,911
届け未来的大ショウタイム
Reach out to the future, a grand Showtime!

266
00:40:10,111 --> 00:40:12,611
自信持って もっと激しく遊べ
Have confidence and play harder and wilder!

267
00:40:12,911 --> 00:40:14,811
My sister 今もセーガクジ
My sister, even now as students,

268
00:40:15,111 --> 00:40:19,911
全部叶えていこうよ
let's make all our dreams come true!

269
00:40:20,111 --> 00:40:24,611
夢見る力が地上の星を照らせば
If the power of dreaming illuminates the stars on earth,

270
00:40:25,111 --> 00:40:29,911
誰かの好きが繋がって So Miracle
someone's passions connect—so miraculous.

271
00:40:30,111 --> 00:40:34,111
またいつか花開くよ そらサイコー
Someday flowers will bloom again, sky high!

272
00:40:48,111 --> 00:40:51,911
ぼくら自分と世界の時間を今5月で
Counting down the time for ourselves and the world this May,

273
00:40:52,111 --> 00:40:57,611
世界が大人になってると勘違いして
we mistook it for the world growing up.

274
00:40:58,111 --> 00:41:02,611
あるときーループから放り出されて
Then suddenly thrown out of the loop,

275
00:41:03,111 --> 00:41:06,611
変わり映えしない日々に戸惑う
we're bewildered by unchanging days.

276
00:41:08,111 --> 00:41:13,111
誰かの夢が連鎖してゆくのは
Someone's dream chaining onward—

277
00:41:13,311 --> 00:41:18,311
自由を縛る鎖じゃなくて
it's not a chain binding our freedom,

278
00:41:19,111 --> 00:41:23,611
少しずつでもまだ見ぬ世界
even if just a little, a world yet unseen

279
00:41:24,111 --> 00:41:27,111
見えてたらいいよね
if we could see it, wouldn't that be nice?

280
00:41:28,111 --> 00:41:30,111
飛び出せ Say Hello!
Jump out and say hello!

281
00:41:30,311 --> 00:41:33,111
響け宇宙的Big Wave!
Resonate, cosmic Big Wave!

282
00:41:33,611 --> 00:41:38,611
瞳輝かせた君が好きさ My sister
I love you with your sparkling eyes, my sister.

283
00:41:39,111 --> 00:41:44,111
今もセイガジ いつも全身全霊で
Even now as students, always with all our might,

284
00:41:44,311 --> 00:41:47,611
磁力線の向こう側目指して
aiming for the other side of the magnetic field,

285
00:41:48,111 --> 00:41:53,611
一瞬の閃光が永遠のステージで
a momentary flash on an eternal stage

286
00:41:54,111 --> 00:41:59,111
この世界を変えてくよ そらサイコー
will change this world, sky high!

287
00:42:24,611 --> 00:42:29,111
懐かしいことが心地いいとき
When nostalgic things feel comforting,

288
00:42:29,611 --> 00:42:34,111
新しいことは辛いこと
new things feel difficult.

289
00:42:34,311 --> 00:42:37,111
それでも
Even so,

290
00:42:37,311 --> 00:42:42,611
新しい明日が見たい
I want to see a new tomorrow.

291
00:42:44,611 --> 00:42:47,111
飛び出せ Say Hello!
Jump out and say hello!

292
00:42:47,311 --> 00:42:49,911
届け未来的大ショウタイム
Reach out to the future, a grand Showtime!

293
00:42:50,111 --> 00:42:54,611
自信持って もっと激しく遊べ My sister
Have confidence and play harder and wilder, my sister!

294
00:42:55,111 --> 00:42:59,611
今もセーガジ 全部叶えていこうよ
Even now as students, let's make it all come true!

295
00:43:00,111 --> 00:43:05,111
夢見る力が地上の星を照らせば
If the power of dreaming illuminates the stars on earth,

296
00:43:05,311 --> 00:43:09,611
誰かの好きが繋がって So Miracle
someone's passions connect—so miraculous.

297
00:43:10,111 --> 00:43:14,611
またいつか花開くよ そらサイコー
Someday flowers will bloom again, sky high!

298
00:43:15,111 --> 00:43:19,611
僕らの今が君を動かして
Our present moment moves you,

299
00:43:20,111 --> 00:43:24,611
またいつか花開くよ そらサイコー
and someday flowers will bloom again, sky high!

300
00:44:17,111 --> 00:44:22,611
がんばってだめだって 落ち込んだ日もあるでしょう
Even on days when you tried your best and failed,

301
00:44:23,111 --> 00:44:26,611
ほら 探しに行こう シェケナベイベー☆
come on, let's go search for it, shake it baby☆

302
00:44:27,111 --> 00:44:32,111
いつだって 今だって みんながくれた希望は
Always, right now, the hope everyone gave us

303
00:44:32,311 --> 00:44:37,611
意地っ張りな僕を変えてくれた
changed my stubborn self.

304
00:44:38,111 --> 00:44:42,611
部屋の隅でかかえてた 伝えたい歌とギターのように
Like the song and guitar I held in the corner of my room,

305
00:44:43,111 --> 00:44:47,111
空に浮かぶあの願いは 世界動かす秘めた誓い
that wish floating in the sky is a hidden vow that moves the world.

306
00:44:48,111 --> 00:44:52,111
ありがとう 走りだした 夢をのせ 坂をこえて
Thank you, I started running, carrying my dreams over the hill,

307
00:44:52,311 --> 00:44:56,611
信じ合えるさ 迷わない！ そう思っていた
believing in each other, no hesitation! That's what I thought.

308
00:44:56,911 --> 00:45:01,111
君を照らす光になると信じて ありがとう これからだよ
Believing I'll become the light that shines on you, thank you, from now on.

309
00:45:02,623 --> 00:45:03,573
走り出した
Running forward,

310
00:45:03,573 --> 00:45:05,473
夢をのせて
carrying our dreams,

311
00:45:05,473 --> 00:45:07,903
坂を越えて
climbing over the hills,

312
00:45:07,903 --> 00:45:10,483
信じ合えるさ
we can believe in each other.

313
00:45:11,023 --> 00:45:15,123
迷わない！そう思っていた
