317
00:45:24,183 --> 00:45:26,973
つれてくから
I'll take you along

318
00:45:27,293 --> 00:45:29,153
夢の先へ
to the beyond of our dreams.

319
00:45:29,423 --> 00:45:32,213
君がいるなら
With you by my side,

320
00:45:32,693 --> 00:45:37,733
叶わないはずないよなんてね
nothing is impossible, or so I thought.

321
00:45:39,503 --> 00:45:41,863
調子のっちゃって
Getting a little carried away

322
00:45:42,353 --> 00:45:44,463
もいいよね
is fine, right?

323
00:45:47,153 --> 00:45:51,893
いつだって今だって この背中を押したのは
Whenever and wherever, what pushed my back forward

324
00:45:52,283 --> 00:45:56,523
空で笑いかけてくれた君だ
was you, smiling up at the sky.

325
00:45:59,243 --> 00:46:05,583
これからも泣きたくなるような日は来る
Even from now on, there will be days I want to cry,

326
00:46:06,183 --> 00:46:09,793
そんなものは振り払って
but I'll shake those feelings off

327
00:46:12,313 --> 00:46:15,963
待ち合わせはして見よう
and let's make a promise to meet again.

328
00:46:16,383 --> 00:46:19,783
どこまでだって行けるよ
We can go anywhere at all!

329
00:46:29,383 --> 00:46:31,683
わかんない、このままでいいの？
I don't know, is this okay as it is?

330
00:46:31,683 --> 00:46:34,353
わかんない、抱きしめて
I don't know, hold me tight,

331
00:46:34,883 --> 00:46:39,783
生まれたままの素足で育ってよ
grow up with your bare feet just as you were born.

332
00:46:48,733 --> 00:46:55,703
抱いていた あの場所には 僕ではない
In that place I once embraced, it wasn't me...

333
00:46:56,783 --> 00:47:05,623
誰かがいた にじんだ先に 見えた光を待っていた
...someone else was there, waiting for the light that blurred in the distance.

334
00:47:06,543 --> 00:47:10,123
弱虫の ひとりじめした奇跡
A miracle selfishly claimed by a coward—

335
00:47:10,413 --> 00:47:12,383
ありがとう
Thank you.

336
00:47:12,913 --> 00:47:15,123
走り出した
Running forward,

337
00:47:15,123 --> 00:47:17,053
夢をのせて
carrying our dreams,

338
00:47:17,053 --> 00:47:19,563
坂を越えて
climbing over the hills,

339
00:47:19,873 --> 00:47:22,253
信じ合えるさ
we can believe in each other.

340
00:47:22,703 --> 00:47:26,873
迷わない！そう思っていた
I thought I'd never hesitate!

341
00:47:27,273 --> 00:47:30,993
君を照らす 光になると信じて
Believing I'd become a light to shine on you,

342
00:47:31,383 --> 00:47:33,333
ありがとう
Thank you.

343
00:47:41,393 --> 00:47:43,413
