414
00:52:18,040 --> 00:52:19,340
hey! are you ready?

415
00:52:19,340 --> 00:52:22,040
let's get ready to break the wall! come on!

416
00:52:22,340 --> 00:52:25,040
five. four. three. two. one.

417
00:52:25,240 --> 00:52:26,540
explosion!

418
00:52:27,540 --> 00:52:33,040
未来予感した あの場所から私のブレイクは壊れていた
From that place where I sensed the future, my break was broken.

419
00:52:33,340 --> 00:52:37,040
クレシェンドが止まらない 振り返らない！
The crescendo won't stop, I won't look back!

420
00:52:37,340 --> 00:52:39,040
can you set me free?

421
00:52:39,340 --> 00:52:40,340
解き放て
Unleash it!

422
00:52:41,040 --> 00:52:45,040
流した涙のカケラ握りしめ
